  <div class="f1g-panel f1g-panel--hide" id="f1g-path">
    <p class="f1g-intro">You are currently in 11th grade in NJ, strong in maths, physics, and robotics. Here is a concrete path to F1 — with two tracks depending on which part of the sport interests you most.</p>

    <div class="f1g-path-tracks">
      <button class="f1g-track-btn f1g-track-btn--on" data-track="eng">⚙️ Engineering Track (Aero / VD / Powertrain)</button>
